+- `GOOS=windows GOARCH=amd64 go test -c ... ./internal/godriver` and `GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 go test -c ... ./internal/godriver` — pass. Native Windows/Linux runtime evidence is unavailable on this macOS host.
